type: software
title: "ForeFlow Agents"
abstract: >
  Five on-chain forecasting agents implementing the coordination configurations
  from "Coordination as an Architectural Layer for LLM-Based Multi-Agent Systems".
  Each agent wraps a pre-registered coordination configuration with ERC-8004
  commit-reveal on Polygon.
